# The Debian packages of the base image (images/base.Dockerfile installs
# them): the common build basics the runtimes and the generated code's builds
# use. The image carries nothing else but Debian's base system and what these
# depend on: tacplus-packages-check (images/packages-check.sh) fails its build
# otherwise (#554). Add a package here, never through an image it starts from.
# build-essential (the C toolchain Rust links with and the cc crates build
# with), procps, xz-utils and zlib1g-dev came from buildpack-deps before.
bash
build-essential
ca-certificates
curl
file
git
jq
libssl-dev
pkg-config
procps
python3
unzip
xz-utils
zlib1g-dev
